NEXUS ENGINE is free to use. Anyone may download it, install it, and use
it to make games, for free, forever. There is no charge, no trial, and no
paid version that unlocks features. It is as powerful as the big engines,
and it costs nothing.

The source code is NOT open. The code that makes NEXUS ENGINE work belongs
to Samrath Singh, known as sami9889, of Melbourne, Australia, and it stays
closed. That is the deal: the engine is free, the code is not yours.

You MAY:
- download, install and run NEXUS ENGINE on your own computer, for free;
- make games and other content with it, and sell or share those games;
- keep every cent you make from the games you create with it.

