- copy, reproduce or redistribute NEXUS ENGINE itself or any part of it,
  in source code or compiled form, by any means;
- modify, adapt, reverse engineer, decompile or disassemble NEXUS ENGINE
  or any part of it, except where such restriction is prohibited by law;
- sublicense, sell, rent, lease, lend or give away NEXUS ENGINE or any
  part of it;
- remove or alter any copyright notice in NEXUS ENGINE;
- use NEXUS ENGINE or any part of it in your own product, service or
  project.

Games and other content that you create with NEXUS ENGINE are yours.
This license covers the engine and editor software itself, not the games
you make with it.

